      {
        "quote": "s231 of the Employment Rights Act 1996 provides: \"Associated Employers For the purposes of this Act any two employers shall be treated as associated if- (a) one is a company of which the other (directly or indirectly) has control, or (b) both are companies of which a third person (directly or indirectly) has control; and 'associated employer' shall be construed accordingly.\"",
